<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="UI Prompt Package is taking shape. A practical place to start your next interface." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f3ed" />
    <title>UI Prompt Package — Coming soon</title>
    <style>
      :root { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #202720; background: #f5f3ed; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100svh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      header, footer { padding: 28px clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
      .brand { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.5px; }
      .badge { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; border: 1px solid #d7dbcf; border-radius: 30px; padding: 9px 13px; white-space: nowrap; }
      main { flex: 1; width: 100%; max-width: 1300px; margin: auto; padding: 100px clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px); }
      .eyebrow { color: #56734c; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { max-width: 900px; margin: 25px 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 108px); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.065em; text-wrap: balance; }
      h1 span { color: #6a8057; }
      .description { max-width: 460px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #61665b; }
      .note { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
      .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #738a61; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid #dedfd6; color: #74796e; font-size: 12px; }
      @media (max-width: 600px) { main { padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 70px; } header { flex-wrap: wrap; } footer { align-items: flex-start; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header><div class="brand">UI Prompt Package</div><span class="badge">In the making</span></header>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">A clearer place to start</p>
      <h1>Good interfaces<br />start with <span>good direction.</span></h1>
      <p class="description">We're putting UI Prompt Package together. A practical starting point for turning your ideas into thoughtful interfaces.</p>
      <p class="note"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Coming soon. Taking shape, one detail at a time.</p>
    </main>
    <footer><span>UI Prompt Package</span><span>Made with intention.</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
